Package: clinanalysis
Type: Package
Title: Contract-Driven Clinical Statistical Analysis
Version: 0.0.1.9002
Authors@R: person("Local", "Researcher", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "local@example.invalid")
Description: A local, contract-driven engine for reproducible clinical
    statistical analysis, diagnostics, tables, figures, and machine-readable
    result bundles. It has standing read-only access to locally stored public
    research data, while formal execution remains frozen-task, registered-data,
    checksum, and one-shot-authorization gated. Candidate-bound materialization
    is supported; this is not a general phenotype platform.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
